t are supplied
in the accompanying repair/re-audit package.\par\medskip
\small
\begin{longtable}{>{\raggedright\arraybackslash}p{.40\textwidth}>{\raggedright\arraybackslash}p{.50\textwidth}}
\toprule
Result & What is actually proved / what is not\\\midrule\endhead
Frozen arbitration & Deterministic scoped evidence vector, display ordering and revocation; not a logical priority of truths.\\
Typed cardinality & $31$ components by construction; not 31 deployed programs.\\
Federated noncontamination & Every ledger insertion checked; semantic truth additionally assumes sound $V$.\\
Verifier neutrality & Same complete raw verifier input, same result; ledger admission can depend on current state.\\
Guard dependence & Strong receipts imply base semantic nonentailment in both directions; typed $I$ requires separate check.\\
Nonvacuous minimal-guard basis & Relative up-set inside satisfiable guards; complete atlas also needs checked SAT, negative and coverage evidence.\\
Dual-model bridge & Strong, nonvacuous dependence witnesses semantic nonentailment both ways at the base context; typed $I$ requires a separate check.\\
Deletion-witness minimality & Verified immediate deletions certify inclusion-minimal guard.\\
Scope safety & No unlicensed dependency paths if gates enforced.\\
Passive embedding & Trace projection with sufficient extra budget; not free simulation.\\
Two-level cyclic bound & $25m$ executed dispatches; wall time only with uniform duration and final-check limits.\\
DAG reuse & Exact accounting identity; saving iff avoided duplication exceeds overhead.\\
No universal cost dominance & Fixed overhead defeats blanket strict speedup.\\
Game-aware quotient & Finite-horizon reachability under explicit complete one-service macrosteps; not elapsed time or general stochastic cost.\\
Inconsistency quarantine & Scoped contradiction blocks new safety reports and tags old governed ones revoked; not universal detection.\\
Infrastructure example & Graph-reachability and certified paths only; not physical safety.\\
Ocean counterexample & Finite suites are not universal proof without more premises.\\
\bottomrule
\end{longtable}
\normalsize

\chapter{Source and notation notes}
\begin{description}[style=nextline,leftmargin=2.4cm]
\item[$B^\star$] Distinguished global Player-0; not BANK and not an internal $B_0^r$.
\item[$B_0^r$] Role-local FORGE-6 coordinator, without direct mathematical proof authority.
\item[$B_j^r$] For $j=1,\ldots,5$, one of five role-local mathematical ATPs.
\item[$K_0$] Frozen, certified BANK baseline. No silent write-back.
\item[$L_t$] Provisional, verifier-accepted and support-closed ledger.
\item[$U_t$] Speculative candidate store; not trusted assertions.
\item[$D$] Dependence role, with strong guarded receipts as one explicit semantics.
\item[$I$] Independence relative to a fixed theory and declared metatheory.
\item[$C$] Contradiction/inconsistency relative to a declared context.
\item[$\Pi_0$] Immutable scoped arbiter and revocation policy.
\item[$\mathcal C$] Family of satisfiable guard contexts; inconsistent contexts are inadmissible for the security atlas.
\item[$\xRightarrow{a}$] One charged service with complete zero-service microstep closure.
\item[$\mathsf{UNKNOWN}$] Bounded nonsettlement after stop, not pending, independence, or a role.
\end{description}

